    "detailed_description": "MaryPark St. is a short story telling indie game, set in a black and white dream-like world. Following the main character, trying to get to his friend who seems to always be busy, as each day feels more and more repetitive. Additionally now as a free update it includes the second interpretation of the story, called &quot;The Nightmare&quot;.<br><br><i>BECAUSE LOVE NEVER DIES</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283850/extras/e5d85a971d153f6403f3849f633c75ed.avif?t=1609218229\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><br><strong>Easy to play:</strong> Generic controls: arrow keys for movement, and Z key to interact. <br><br><strong>Intriguing Storyline:</strong> This game adheres to themes of isolation and self-reflection. MaryPark St. was designed to appeal to mass demographic whilst having it\u2019s short but unique story.<br><br><strong>Unique Atmosphere:</strong> The world of MaryPark St. is entirely black and white. With smooth lineart and only essential details, the setting is ominous and bleak. <br><br><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br><br><strong>Playtime:</strong> Between 10 - 15 minutes.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283850/extras/b95ab42d04f38a5f804368ae2895f7a6.poster.avif?t=1609218229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1283850/extras/b95ab42d04f38a5f804368ae2895f7a6.webm?t=1609218229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div>",
